# Testing

- Pyramid: unit (services) > integration > e2e
- **Factories** in `apps/api/test/factories/**` — no hardcoded literals
- **AAA** comments in every test
- Typed mocks in `test/helpers/**`; `jest.clearAllMocks()` in `afterEach`
- No `any` in specs

